{"Lua-subjugation-capture-tib":"Capture three Tiberium enrichment facilities.","Lua-subjugation-mastermind-survive":"Mastermind must survive.","Lua-subjugation-yuri-taunt":"Your powers are no match for me. Flee through your wormholes, while you can.","Lua-subjugation-tip-mastermind-control":"The Mastermind can mind control up to three enemy units. Mind controlling a fourth will kill the earliest controlled.","Lua-subjugation-tip-mastermind-sparks":"The Mastermind has a targeted ability that creates mind sparks from himself and his slaves which damage and slow nearby enemies (the slaves will be unharmed).","Lua-subjugation-tip-mastermind-buildings":"The Mastermind can take control of enemy buildings. Production structures will be able to produce permanently enslaved units.","Lua-subjugation-tip-stay-away":"Stay out of Yuri's area of influence until your Mastermind becomes powerful enough to protect your units.","Lua-subjugation-capture-yuri-hq":"Capture Yuri's command center.","Lua-subjugation-prodigy":"Enriched ichor consumed. Your Mastermind has become a Prodigy and is able to protect nearby units from Yuri's influence.","Lua-subjugation-capacity-increased":"Enriched ichor consumed. Mastermind mind control capacity increased by 1.","Lua-subjugation-shipment-imminent":"Enriched ichor shipment detected. Dispatch is imminent. Prevent it from reaching Yuri's command center.","Lua-subjugation-shipment-detected":"Enriched ichor shipment detected.","Lua-subjugation-shipment-delivered":"A shipment of enriched ichor has reached Yuri's command center and he has grown more powerful.","Lua-subjugation-tip-guarded":"Yuri's command center is heavily guarded. Brute force is unlikely to be the best approach.","Lua-subjugation-mastermind-fled":"The {0} used its considerable psionic powers to cheat death. It will return in 20 seconds.","Lua-subjugation-speaker-yuri":"Yuri"}
